A PATTERN WORTH NAMING
----------------------
Three of the four defects had a passing test guaranteeing them:

    the isatty gate           (previous commit)
    the two-signal read limit
    the thirty-name dump
    the "nothing is lost" sentence

Every one asserted the MECHANISM rather than the property, so it could not
detect that the mechanism was the wrong one. Same family as `grep "^function"`
on 2026-08-21.
